  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196368/description_d7b23b18-3b65-4322-bc65-3e9498b2c16e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"121\"></strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">农舍装饰专注于适合农场房屋的老式家具。</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以用它来装饰多个房间，如厨房、客厅、卧室和工作室。</p>\n<p>来看看其中的一些元素：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fRCEQtWX/images/6363af6796a3979dae773aeb56f2441089921d80.png\" alt=\"fdm\" width=\"447\" height=\"251\"></p>\n<p>它具体添加了什么：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>床</li>\n<li>灯笼</li>\n<li>衣柜</li>\n<li>布谷鸟钟</li>\n<li>乐器（钢琴和吉他）</li>\n<li>书架</li>\n<li>衣帽架</li>\n<li>酒柜</li>\n<li>床头柜</li>\n<li>工作室配件</li>\n<li>餐桌套装</li>\n<li>沙发</li>\n<li>等等。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcookiecraftmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/generated/fhfuc7slzawvi/2025-11-29_rest-0338e8b30091e10a20507b1b977b3b03-p3s7pb6w.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"600\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>有什么你希望添加到这个模组中的内容吗？或者你发现了什么bug？加入我们的Discord，融入我们的社区吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrVTtKNRkn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://theme.zdassets.com/theme_assets/678183/cc59daa07820943e943c2fc283b9079d7003ff76.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"24\"></a></p>\n<p>如需更多详细信息或支持，请访问我们的网站 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cookiecraftmods.com</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/cookiecraftmods-logo-nobg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\"></a></p>\n<p>看看这些模组：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/m-d-m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/mdm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/edm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/builders-palette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/bp-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/CCM-FULL-BANNER-text.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fZ8Z21OHRJY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi1.png?v=6\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 请我喝咖啡\" width=\"242\" height=\"61\"></a></p>",
